{%- comment -%}
   Renders one item from product.media (image, video, external video or 3D model).

   Accepts:
      media_object - a single item from product.media
      size         - responsive-image size preset (defaults to 'half')
      loading      - 'eager' or 'lazy', passed through to images

   HOW VIDEO WORKS HERE
   The <video> is generated by Shopify's video_tag filter with preload="none",
   so it makes no network request until someone presses play. That is what
   makes it safe for the mobile carousel to repeat a video slide inside every
   variant group: the elements are free, only playback costs anything.

   Three things that will bite anyone editing this:

   1. Do NOT hand-build the <source> from source.url. video_tag produces the
      correct URLs; hand-building emitted a broken one in this theme.

   2. With preload="none" the browser has not begun resource selection, and
      setting .preload later does not start it. The click handler MUST call
      video.load() before play(), otherwise readyState stays at 0 and nothing
      buffers even though play() reports success.

   3. Do NOT give this wrapper the aspect-[8/9] class. theme.liquid has a
      mobile override that sets aspect-ratio:auto and height:auto on that
      class inside the product carousel. Because the <video> is absolutely
      positioned it contributes no height, so the wrapper collapsed to zero
      and the video vanished on mobile while looking fine on desktop.
      The ratio is set inline from the video's own thumbnail instead, which
      also means any aspect ratio works with no code change.

   The poster is Shopify's video thumbnail, set in admin on the video under
   Edit thumbnail. Position in the gallery follows the video's position in the
   product media list, so dragging it in admin moves it here.

   NOTE: the Liquid property is media.preview_image. media.preview.image is the
   GraphQL shape and returns nil, which Shopify renders as a Liquid error
   string inside the attribute rather than failing loudly.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign media_size = size | default: 'half' -%}

<div class="w-full">
   {%- case media_object.media_type -%}

      {%- when 'video' -%}
         {%- assign v_poster = media_object.preview_image -%}
         {%- assign v_w = v_poster.width | default: 2 -%}
         {%- assign v_h = v_poster.height | default: 3 -%}

         <div
            class="overflow-hidden bg-black"
            style="position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: {{ v_w }} / {{ v_h }}; background: #000;"
            data-nge-video
         >
            {{
               media_object
               | video_tag:
                  image_size: '800x',
                  controls: false,
                  autoplay: false,
                  loop: false,
                  muted: false,
                  preload: 'none'
            }}

            <button
               type="button"
               data-nge-video-play
               aria-label="Play video"
               style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 0; z-index: 2;"
            >
               <svg
                  width="72"
                  height="72"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  style="filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.45));"
               >
                  <path
                     d="M8.6 6.4v11.2a.75.75 0 0 0 1.15.63l8.8-5.6a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.26l-8.8-5.6a.75.75 0 0 0-1.15.63Z"
                     stroke="#ffffff"
                     stroke-width="1.25"
                     stroke-linejoin="round"
                     stroke-linecap="round"
                  />
               </svg>
            </button>
         </div>

         <script>
            if (!window.__ngeVideoPlayInit) {
               window.__ngeVideoPlayInit = true;

               var ngeStyle = document.createElement('style');
               ngeStyle.textContent =
                  '[data-nge-video] video{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:#000;}';
               document.head.appendChild(ngeStyle);

               document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
                  var btn = e.target.closest('[data-nge-video-play]');
                  if (!btn) return;
                  var wrap = btn.closest('[data-nge-video]');
                  if (!wrap) return;
                  var video = wrap.querySelector('video');
                  if (!video) return;

                  video.controls = true;
                  video.preload = 'auto';
                  video.load();
                  btn.remove();

                  var p = video.play();
                  if (p && p.catch) { p.catch(function () {}); }
               });
            }
         </script>

      {%- when 'external_video' -%}
         <div class="relative aspect-[8/9] lg:aspect-[2/3] overflow-hidden bg-black">
            {{ media_object | external_video_tag: class: 'w-full h-full' }}
         </div>

      {%- else -%}
         <div class="aspect-[8/9] lg:aspect-[2/3]">
            {% render 'responsive-image',
               image_object: media_object.preview_image,
               size: media_size,
               class: '',
               loading: loading
            %}
         </div>

   {%- endcase -%}
</div>
